Speed is important! But you know that your speed is also influenced by your
burden status. Speed boots make you "very fast"; are you currently at least
"fast"? You may use wands of speed on yourself. If you are unburdened then
another possibility is to use jumping, in difficult situations enhanced by
drinking potions of speed.

At the air level speed is Very Good to have but not necessary, you may also
compensate that by a couple of potions of full healing.

I am usually unwise and go burdened, i.e. make the ascension run at reduced
speed. So in conclusion, the extra speed of the boots is not necessary, but
makes life a lot easier! You should be at least unburdened and be "fast" by
some wand of speed monster or jumping.

And keep in mind that if you stay longer in the dungeons you'll attract more
curses that you occasionally will have to be able to remove. So carry some
more scrolls of remove curse and some holy water.

